# Deep suspend on the Miyoo Flip V2 can lose the OS-card controller during
# resume (mmc0 error -110 / card removed), which aborts the /storage ext4
# journal and can leave the system unusable. ROCKNIX fake suspend also does
# substantially more than blanking the panel and has produced unreliable lid
# wake behaviour on this device.
#
# Keep the lid inert for the safe baseline. A later ButterflyOS-specific lid
# handler may blank only the panel/backlight once that path has passed extended
# resume and storage-integrity testing.

. /etc/profile.d/001-functions

/usr/bin/suspendmode off
set_setting system.suspend.enable 0

